{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415037","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415037","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041503701:1":{"text":"Being a picky eater could lead to malnutrition, you know. That's not good for you.","source_cn":"挑食会营养不良，这对你不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5552DE6448FCC76E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503702:1":{"text":"You might not realize, but Graveborns don't need food.","source_cn":"姐姐，你或许不知道，亡灵不需要吃东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B0F6A799E46F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503703:1":{"text":"Whether you think it tastes good or not, to me, it's all the same as chewing on rocks.","source_cn":"不管是你觉得好吃的还是不好吃的，在我看来都和石头一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9256A6659DC30066","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503704:1":{"text":"I don't want to eat, and honestly, nothing here looks remotely appetizing.","source_cn":"我不想吃东西，那些东西也没一个看起来好吃的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58BF9F4AE9488A42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503705:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503706:1":{"text":"Well then, which \"rock\" do you like best?","source_cn":"那么，你比较喜欢哪种“石头”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA57802F9E4C05A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503707:1":{"text":"Are you kidding me?!","source_cn":"你在开什么玩笑？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A52E543FBED2DF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503708:1":{"text":"Even if all food looks like rocks to you, there has to be one you prefer over the others, right?","source_cn":"食物在你眼里就算都和石头一样，也有相对来说更喜欢的“石...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAC7B9E866652CF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041503709:1":{"text":"So, which one is it? I'll get it for you.","source_cn":"你喜欢哪种？我给你找来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9294B736907A90FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041503710:1":{"text":"And what if I want flesh and blood?","source_cn":"如果我想要的是血肉呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B1DF58C36604528","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041503711:1":{"text":"As long as you don't hurt anyone or scavenge from others, it's fine.","source_cn":"不伤人，不捡别人剩下的吃就行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x468CCC6AACB019D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041503712:1":{"text":"... Huh?","source_cn":"……哈？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA85851513CC18510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041503713:1":{"text":"You're not Sonja, are you?! Who are you and what have you done to my sister?!","source_cn":"你不是索尼娅吧？！谁扮的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8077DDDE9E6BFA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041503714:1":{"text":"... I am your sister.","source_cn":"……我是你的姐姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x195E37D7A997D95E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041503715:1":{"text":"Saying these things now... it's too late.","source_cn":"现在才说这些，太晚了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28FCA746DFFCEF9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"Nara","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":2}}